{"seq":2,"slug":"branching-model","title":"分支模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/branching-model","wordCount":828,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分支模型\">分支模型</h1><h2 id=\"分支的本质\">分支的本质</h2><p>在 Git 中，<strong>分支（Branch）</strong> 本质上是一个指向某个 commit 的可移动指针。创建分支只是创建一个 41 字节的文件（40 字符 SHA-1 + 换行符），几乎没有成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git branch feature&#10;cat .git/refs/heads/feature&#10;&#10;git branch -a&#10;&#10;git log --oneline --graph --all --decorate\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/refs/heads/feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --oneline</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --graph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --decorate</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分支模型回答的核心问题是：代码在何种分支上流动、何时合并回主线。三种主流模型的差异集中在这几个维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分支本质</td>\n<td>指向 commit 的可移动指针，创建成本极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期分支</td>\n<td>长期存在的主线（main、develop）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临时分支</td>\n<td>为单个功能或修复而生的短生命周期分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成频率</td>\n<td>变更回到主线的频率，决定冲突与集成债务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布方式</td>\n<td>持续部署与版本发布之间的取舍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-flow\">Git Flow</h2><p><strong>Git Flow</strong> 是 Vincent Driessen 在 2010 年提出的分支模型，适合有明确版本发布周期的项目。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分支类型</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>合并目标</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>main</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>生产环境代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>develop</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>main</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>集成开发分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>feature/*</td>\n<td>临时</td>\n<td>develop</td>\n<td>develop</td>\n<td>功能开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>release/*</td>\n<td>临时</td>\n<td>develop</td>\n<td>main + develop</td>\n<td>版本发布准备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hotfix/*</td>\n<td>临时</td>\n<td>main</td>\n<td>main + develop</td>\n<td>紧急修复</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git flow init&#10;&#10;git flow feature start user-auth&#10;git flow feature finish user-auth&#10;&#10;git flow release start v1.2.0&#10;git flow release finish v1.2.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> finish</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user-auth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> release</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> finish</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.2.0</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;init&quot;&#10;    branch develop&#10;    commit id: &quot;dev-1&quot;&#10;    branch feature/login&#10;    commit id: &quot;feat-1&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;feat-2&quot;&#10;    checkout develop&#10;    merge feature/login id: &quot;merge-feat&quot;&#10;    branch release/v1.0&#10;    commit id: &quot;bump-ver&quot;&#10;    checkout main&#10;    merge release/v1.0 id: &quot;v1.0&quot; tag: &quot;v1.0.0&quot;&#10;    checkout develop&#10;    merge release/v1.0 id: &quot;sync&quot;\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"init\"\n    branch develop\n    commit id: \"dev-1\"\n    branch feature/login\n    commit id: \"feat-1\"\n    commit id: \"feat-2\"\n    checkout develop\n    merge feature/login id: \"merge-feat\"\n    branch release/v1.0\n    commit id: \"bump-ver\"\n    checkout main\n    merge release/v1.0 id: \"v1.0\" tag: \"v1.0.0\"\n    checkout develop\n    merge release/v1.0 id: \"sync\"</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Git Flow 适合发布周期较长（周/月级别）的项目，对于持续部署的 SaaS 产品可能过于复杂。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-flow\">GitHub Flow</h2><p><strong>GitHub Flow</strong> 是 GitHub 推荐的简化分支模型，核心原则是 main 分支始终可部署。</p>\n<p>工作流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout -b feature/new-header&#10;git add -A &amp;&amp; git commit -m &quot;feat: add new header component&quot;&#10;git push origin feature/new-header\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/new-header</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: add new header component\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/new-header</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[从 main 创建分支] --&gt; B[在分支上开发提交]&#10;    B --&gt; C[发起 Pull Request]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Code Review + CI]&#10;    D --&gt; E[合并到 main]&#10;    E --&gt; F[自动部署]\">graph LR\n    A[从 main 创建分支] --&gt; B[在分支上开发提交]\n    B --&gt; C[发起 Pull Request]\n    C --&gt; D[Code Review + CI]\n    D --&gt; E[合并到 main]\n    E --&gt; F[自动部署]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>从 main 创建分支</td>\n<td>分支名体现功能意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>提交更改</td>\n<td>小步提交，保持原子性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>发起 PR</td>\n<td>描述变更内容和测试方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Review + CI</td>\n<td>代码审查通过且 CI 绿灯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>合并并部署</td>\n<td>合并后自动触发生产部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"trunk-based-development\">Trunk-Based Development</h2><p><strong>Trunk-Based Development（主干开发）</strong> 要求所有开发者频繁（至少每天）向主干分支（trunk/main）提交代码，配合<strong>特性开关（Feature Flag）</strong> 控制功能发布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git checkout main&#10;git pull --rebase origin main&#10;&#10;git add -A &amp;&amp; git commit -m &quot;feat: add dark mode behind flag&quot;&#10;git push origin main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: add dark mode behind flag\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>Trunk-Based</th>\n<th>Git Flow</th>\n<th>GitHub Flow</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长期分支数</td>\n<td>1（main）</td>\n<td>2（main+develop）</td>\n<td>1（main）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能分支</td>\n<td>极短或无</td>\n<td>长生命周期</td>\n<td>短生命周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并频率</td>\n<td>每天多次</td>\n<td>按功能完成</td>\n<td>PR 合并时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布方式</td>\n<td>持续部署</td>\n<td>版本发布</td>\n<td>持续部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feature Flag</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用团队</td>\n<td>高成熟度团队</td>\n<td>传统开发团队</td>\n<td>大多数团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"unknown\" data-source=\"gitGraph&#10;    commit id: &quot;A&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;B&quot;&#10;    branch short-lived&#10;    commit id: &quot;C&quot;&#10;    checkout main&#10;    merge short-lived id: &quot;D&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;E&quot;&#10;    commit id: &quot;F&quot;\">gitGraph\n    commit id: \"A\"\n    commit id: \"B\"\n    branch short-lived\n    commit id: \"C\"\n    checkout main\n    merge short-lived id: \"D\"\n    commit id: \"E\"\n    commit id: \"F\"</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Trunk-Based Development 对 CI/CD 基础设施和团队纪律要求很高，但它能有效减少合并冲突和集成债务。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"如何选择分支策略\">如何选择分支策略</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A{发布频率?} --&gt;|每天/随时| B{团队规模?}&#10;    A --&gt;|按版本| C[Git Flow]&#10;    B --&gt;|小团队| D[Trunk-Based]&#10;    B --&gt;|中大团队| E[GitHub Flow]\">graph TD\n    A{发布频率?} --&gt;|每天/随时| B{团队规模?}\n    A --&gt;|按版本| C[Git Flow]\n    B --&gt;|小团队| D[Trunk-Based]\n    B --&gt;|中大团队| E[GitHub Flow]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开源项目，外部贡献者多</td>\n<td>GitHub Flow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动端 App，按版本发布</td>\n<td>Git Flow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SaaS 产品，持续部署</td>\n<td>Trunk-Based</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初创团队，快速迭代</td>\n<td>GitHub Flow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型企业，严格发布流程</td>\n<td>Git Flow</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((分支模型))&#10;    Git Flow&#10;      main + develop&#10;      feature / release / hotfix&#10;      版本发布&#10;    GitHub Flow&#10;      main 始终可部署&#10;      PR 驱动&#10;      持续部署&#10;    Trunk-Based&#10;      主干开发&#10;      Feature Flag&#10;      高频集成&#10;    选择依据&#10;      发布频率&#10;      团队规模&#10;      CI/CD 成熟度\">mindmap\n  root((分支模型))\n    Git Flow\n      main + develop\n      feature / release / hotfix\n      版本发布\n    GitHub Flow\n      main 始终可部署\n      PR 驱动\n      持续部署\n    Trunk-Based\n      主干开发\n      Feature Flag\n      高频集成\n    选择依据\n      发布频率\n      团队规模\n      CI/CD 成熟度</pre><ul>\n<li>Git <strong>分支</strong>本质是指向 commit 的轻量指针，创建和切换成本极低</li>\n<li><strong>Git Flow</strong> 适合版本化发布的项目，通过多分支类型管理不同阶段的代码</li>\n<li><strong>GitHub Flow</strong> 以 PR 为核心，简洁高效，适合持续部署的大多数团队</li>\n<li><strong>Trunk-Based Development</strong> 追求极致的持续集成，依赖 Feature Flag 实现功能与发布解耦</li>\n<li>选择分支策略需综合考虑<strong>发布频率、团队规模和 CI/CD 成熟度</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分支模型","id":"分支模型"},{"level":2,"text":"分支的本质","id":"分支的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Git Flow","id":"git-flow"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Flow","id":"github-flow"},{"level":2,"text":"Trunk-Based Development","id":"trunk-based-development"},{"level":2,"text":"如何选择分支策略","id":"如何选择分支策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Git 内部原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/git-internals"},"next":{"title":"合并与变基","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/foundations/merge-and-rebase"}}